== Custom content notes ==
* ''script:'' <code>X3_S3_PalMount</code>
* To change the duration to 2 hours per level, set a module-level [[local variable|local integer]] called <code>X3_HORSE_PALADIN_USE_PHB</code> to the value 1 (or any non-zero number).
* The function <code>HorseSummonPaladinMount()</code> in <code>x3_inc_horse</code> enforces the restriction that this ability can only be used by characters with at least five paladin levels.
* The mount is technically a henchman, not a summoned creature, in order to facilitate mounting and dismounting.